# Tofu Context Health Bar

Live gauge on the left flank of `.chat-wrapper` showing prompt-token usage
as a % of the active model's context window. Three per-theme variants.

## Files
- `static/js/context-bar.js` — module + `_CONTEXT_LIMITS` regex/constant table
  (mirrors `lib/tasks_pkg/compaction.py` `_get_context_limit()`). Mounted as
  `<aside id="contextHealthBar" class="ctx-health-bar">` on first call to
  `updateContextBar()`. Public hooks: `window.updateContextBar()`,
  `window._resolveContextLimit(modelId)`.
- `static/styles.css` — appended at end-of-file with marker
  `Context Health Bar — left-flank gauge of prompt-token usage`.
- `index.html` — script tag added immediately after `main.js`.

## Visual variants (selected by `[data-theme]`)
- **dark / no-attr** — Aurora reactor core: glass capsule (backdrop-blur),
  indigo→amber→terracotta→crimson aurora gradient, `ctx-aurora-pulse` on
  hot/crit, `ctx-shake-tick` on bar at crit.
- **light** — Linear pill: clean white pill, solid indigo→amber→orange→red
  fill, Source Serif Pro numerals, NO shake (calm-by-design); crit zone
  shows diagonal red stripe instead.
- **tofu** — Pixel tofu stack: 12 stacked claymorphic cells inside a
  `var(--stitch)`-bordered well, kinako/shoyu/tobiko/azuki palette, top
  cells `ctx-tofu-squish`-jiggle in hot/crit, crit-pulse on outer shadow.

## Update hooks (must trigger `updateContextBar()`)
1. `static/js/ui.js` — every `assistantMsg.usage = …` write (4 sites: state
   snapshot, endpoint planner_done, streaming-end merge, final data merge).
2. `static/js/main.js` — `_applyModelUI` (model swap → limit changes),
   `_restoreConvToolState` (conv switch), `newChat` (reset to 0).

## Token math
- Reads the **last** assistant message in `activeConv.messages` that has
  `usage`. Uses the same Anthropic-style detection as `ui.js:1853`:
  if `prompt_tokens <= cw + cr && (cw>0||cr>0)` → total = `inp + cw + cr`,
  else total = `inp` (OpenAI convention).
- Zone thresholds: `>=0.95` crit, `>=0.82` hot (matches Layer-2 trigger
  `_SUMMARY_TRIGGER_RATIO` in `compaction.py`), `>=0.60` warn, else ok.

## Responsive
- Hidden under 900 px (`@media (max-width:900px)`) — mirrors `.turn-nav`.
- Faded to opacity 0.6 between 900–1080 px so it doesn't crowd `.chat-inner`
  at its 820 px max-width.

## Updating the model-limit table
When a new model family ships, add a `[regex, limitOrFunction]` row to
`_CONTEXT_LIMITS` in `context-bar.js`. Keep server-side
`lib/tasks_pkg/compaction.py:_get_context_limit` in sync — it's the
authority and drives auto-compaction decisions.

